      "claim": "When a law creates an ordinary classification, the Constitution applies the rational‑basis test.",
      "evidence": "Equal‑Protection doctrine: suspect classes → strict scrutiny; quasi‑suspect classes (gender, legitimacy) → intermediate scrutiny; all others → rational‑basis review.",
      "weight": 0.35,
      "depends_on": [1]
    },
